]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 45 of 75 years. On that same middle, February to March got 14% of normal in 2025, and March to April got 17% of normal in 2026. Grid 16608 had its driest year in 2003 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
